<Page title="Disclaimer | toolwise" heading="Disclaimer" updated="November 12, 2026" description="Calculator results on toolwise are estimates for general information, not financial, medical or legal advice.">
  <p>The tools and information on toolwise.org are provided for general information and convenience only.</p>

  <h2>Calculators give estimates</h2>
  <p>
    Our calculators use standard formulas and the numbers you enter to produce estimates. Real-world results can differ because of rounding,
    fees, taxes, local rules, changing rates and personal circumstances that a simple calculator cannot take into account.
  </p>

  <h2>Not financial advice</h2>
  <p>
    Finance calculators (such as the mortgage, loan, retirement and compound interest calculators) do not provide financial, investment, tax or
    lending advice. Before making financial decisions, check the figures with your lender or a qualified financial professional.
  </p>

  <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    Health calculators (such as the BMI, calorie, body fat, pregnancy due date and ovulation calculators) give general estimates based on
    population averages. They are not a diagnosis and are not a substitute for advice from a doctor, midwife or other qualified health
    professional. Never use an ovulation calculator as a method of contraception.
  </p>

  <h2>Not legal advice</h2>
  <p>
    Tools that help with documents, citations or signatures do not provide legal advice. Whether an electronic signature or document is
    accepted depends on the laws and the organization involved.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We test our tools carefully, but we cannot guarantee that every result is complete, accurate or up to date. Keep copies of your original
    files and double-check results that matter. If you spot a mistake, please <a href="/contact">let us know</a> so we can fix it.
  </p>
</Page>
